 "remarks": "Unlock the potential of this diamond in the rough in this PRIME Riverside location! Spacious and sun-filled 4 bedroom home overlooking Binney Park. Living room with fireplace, eat-in-kitchen, large family room adjacent to kitchen. Sun-room overlooks the generous slate patio and fenced-in yard. Three bedrooms on the first floor, with Primary suite on the second floor. Huge family room in the walkout lower level with fireplace and bathroom. Close to everything....schools, train, stores and Perot Library. The plot is .38 of an acre -16,553 square feet- which allows the construction of a new house of 5,269 square feet. R 12 zoning.",
